WEBVTT

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.655
na jedini mogući način,

00:06:31.655 --> 00:06:33.844
pognite glavu i radite,

00:06:33.844 --> 00:06:35.666
radite vredno i istrajno,

00:06:35.666 --> 00:06:37.352
sa poštovanjem

00:06:37.352 --> 00:06:39.396
radite na onome što ta ljubav

00:06:39.396 --> 00:06:41.476
od vas traži.

00:06:41.476 --> 00:06:43.660
Samo radite na tome i nastavite tako

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.309
još, još i još

00:06:45.309 --> 00:06:48.275
i garantujem vam, iz svog dugog iskustva,

00:06:48.275 --> 00:06:50.220
uveravam vas

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.290
da će sve biti dobro.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:53.981
Hvala vam.

00:06:53.981 --> 00:06:59.750
(Aplauz)